# Which P-flag and Mask-bits to set when a player changes status...
# The higher levels inherit bits from lower.  Levels can be skipped,
# but the order must be from lower levels to higher ones.  If you
# change your level names, they must be changed here too.

PflagNovice:
  TitleEdit Emote Aberchat

PflagApprentice:
  Resurrect Stats WreckDoors Reset SummonObj Weather Trace Peace
  NoHassle

PflagEmeriti:
  Goto Echo StartInvis Punt

PflagWizard:
  NoTrace NoSnoop NoZap NoSummon NoSteal NoForce NoAlias MflagEdit
  ObjectEdit Heal AliasMob StartInvis RoomEdit Clone Timeout LoadStore 
  NoExorcise NoBurn Burn Sic Zap Exorcise

MaskWizard:
  NoExorcise

PflagIstari:
  Raw SeeSocket SeeHost PuntAll

MaskIstari:
  NoPunt

PflagArchWizard:
  UAFInfo PflagEdit AliasPlayers Frob ChMobData Snoop ChScore ChLevel
  NoProbation ChCoins

PflagShalafi:
  Reboot SflagEdit Crash Ban SeeUser Probation SeeAnon

PflagGod:
  MaskEdit IgnoreNoAt NoPunt NoForget EflagEdit TextRaw PZap
  NoSic CanLog FList NflagEdit ChatMod Socket NoTimeOut SeeIdle ViewCom
  Syslog Lock

MaskGod:
  IgnoreNoAt

PflagCreator:
  Signal

